[l_english.MODULE_TURRET_1A_THROW]
Thrower

[l_english.MODULE_TURRET_1A_THROW_desc]
When your enemy is approaching with a screen door and you don’t have any mushrooms or it is daytime and you don’t have coffee beans, try the thrower.

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_TURRET_1A_THROW]
投掷器

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_TURRET_1A_THROW_desc]
当敌方拿着一扇铁门向你靠近，而你身边又没有蘑菇或者现在是白天而你又没有咖啡豆的时候，试试投掷器。
